<title>USA: Enron Global Power files for 3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Enron Global Power files for 3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Global Power &amp; Pipelines LLC on Friday filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for the offering of up to 3.0 million common shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be sold by Enron Corp and terms of the offering will be determined at the time of sale, according to the filing.</p>
<p>Houston-based Enron Global acquires, owns and manages Enron Corp's power plants and natural gas pipelines outside the United States, Canada and Western Europe.</p>
</text>
